The documentation site under site/ bundles three typefaces into its built
output, so their attribution travels with what it publishes. Each is
licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, which requires this notice
to accompany the font files:

  IBM Plex Mono   Copyright 2017 IBM Corp., with Reserved Font Name "Plex"
                  https://github.com/IBM/plex

  Inter Tight     Copyright 2022 The Inter Project Authors
                  https://github.com/rsms/inter-tight

  Source Serif 4  Copyright 2014-2023 Adobe, with Reserved Font Name
                  "Source"
                  https://github.com/adobe-fonts/source-serif

Each package ships the full OFL-1.1 text; it is installed with the font
under node_modules/@fontsource/ and is not vendored into this repository.
